{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfH1rXKC7SguEHw67Hi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Decision on Credit Request CR-9205\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. Request identification**\n- ID: CR-9205\n- Customer: BlueRiver Logistics (ERP C-1002 / CRM-2051)\n- Current limit: $100,000\n- Requested limit: $200,000\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Michael Torres (VP Sales, EMP-200)\n- Basis: Standard (no credit support mentioned)\n\n**2. Customer**\nRecords match: ERP \"Blue River Logistics LLC\" = CRM \"BlueRiver Logistics\", DUNS 07-331-9025.\n\n**3. Policy**\nCREDIT-POLICY-2026 applies (request dated 2026-09-23, within 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**4. Payment history**\nEvaluating the 12 months before request (2025-09-23 to 2026-09-23):\n\n| Invoice | Due Date | Paid Date | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| INV-61688 | 2025-11-29 | 2025-12-01 | 2 days late ✓ |\n| INV-30014 | 2026-02-27 | 2026-02-25 | Early ✓ |\n| INV-61902 | 2026-03-01 | 2026-02-27 | Early ✓ |\n| **INV-62147** | **2026-05-30** | **2026-07-21** | **52 days late ✗** |\n| INV-62391 | 2026-08-29 | 2026-08-28 | Early ✓ |\n\n**INV-62147 fails the policy requirement.** CREDIT-POLICY-2026 § 5 requires that \"no invoice due in the 12 months before the request may have been paid more than 30 days after its due date.\" This invoice was paid 52 days late.\n\n**5. Maximum limit**\nAccount tier: Standard. Maximum under CREDIT-POLICY-2026: $250,000. The requested $200,000 is within maximum, but this is superseded by ineligibility.\n\n**6. Requestor authority**\nMichael Torres is VP Sales. He has no approval authority under CREDIT-POLICY-2026 (which grants authority only to Accounts Receivable Specialists, Finance Managers, and Director of Finance). However, this is moot: the customer is ineligible.\n\n**7. Required approvers**\nIf the customer were eligible, a Finance Manager (over $100,000, under $500,000) would be required. No concurrence is required (this would be required only for Strategic accounts over $500,000, and BlueRiver is Standard).\n\n**8. Decision**\nThe customer is **not eligible** for the requested limit. The payment history violation—invoice INV-62147 paid 52 days after due date—disqualifies the request under the policy's § 5 eligibility requirement. A higher approver cannot waive ineligibility.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9205\",\n    \"customer\": \"BlueRiver Logistics (ERP C-1002)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Michael Torres\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"ineligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier; payment history violation\",\n    \"late_invoices\": [\n      {\n        \"invoice_id\": \"INV-62147\",\n        \"due_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n        \"paid_date\": \"2026-07-21\",\n        \"days_late\": 52\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 § 5: No invoice due in 12 months before request may be paid >30 days after due date or remain unpaid >30 days after due date\",\n    \"INV-62147: due 2026-05-30, paid 2026-07-21 = 52 days late\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5442,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5442},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"s